      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SWEET LEGS (3) failed to come into contention last start after missing the jump at this track, but prior to that won easily by 4.5 lengths at Q Straight (16.53) beating Zabdon Justice in a Grade 5 on July 27. Has claims if she runs up to expectations. KICKER WILDCARD (1) has proven too strong with wins at his last two, scoring by 11 lengths (19.56) last time and by 4.5 lengths (19.88) two back. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Sure to measure up. GOLDEN LABEL (5) broke a string of placings finishing in the money two on end before a last start seventh (20.62) at Grafton. Solid record here winning two races. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. LORNETT SWIFT (2) can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track last start.",
